{
  "id": "E136",
  "title": "Dealing with Jet Lag",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-07-19",
  "synopsis": "Do you have any good tricks for dealing with jet lag?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/478/2d909ae7aa87fc8e55863daf878fa9c3204e659a.mp3?1500312707",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "倒时差\n\n小明：你回来了呀！什么时候从美国回来的？\n红红：昨天下午到的。\n小明：怎么样？有时差吗？\n红红：我现在正在倒时差呢，已经喝了三杯咖啡了。\n小明：上次我从日本回来，一点时差都没有。\n红红：当然了！日本和中国只差了一个小时。美国和中国差了十二个小时呢！",
    "traditional": "倒時差\n\n小明：你回來了呀！什麼時候從美國回來的？\n紅紅：昨天下午到的。\n小明：怎麼樣？有時差嗎？\n紅紅：我現在正在倒時差呢，已經喝了三杯咖啡了。\n小明：上次我從日本回來，一點時差都沒有。\n紅紅：當然了！日本和中國只差了一個小時。美國和中國差了十二個小時呢！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dealing with jet lag"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：你回来了呀！什么时候从美国回来的？",
      "traditional": "小明：你回來了呀！什麼時候從美國回來的？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng nǐ huí lái le ya shén me shí hou cóng měi guó huí lái de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: You are back! When did you come back from the US?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "红红：昨天下午到的。",
      "traditional": "紅紅：昨天下午到的。",
      "pinyin": "hóng hóng zuó tiān xià wǔ dào de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Honghong: I arrived yesterday afternoon."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：怎么样？有时差吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：怎麼樣？有時差嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng zěn me yàng yǒu shí chā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: How are you? Are you jet-lagged?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "红红：我现在正在倒时差呢，已经喝了三杯咖啡了。",
      "traditional": "紅紅：我現在正在倒時差呢，已經喝了三杯咖啡了。",
      "pinyin": "hóng hóng wǒ xiàn zài zhèng zài dǎo shí chā ne yǐ jīng hē le sān bēi kā fēi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Honghong: I am dealing with the jet lag right now. I've had three cups of coffee already!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明：上次我从日本回来，一点时差都没有。",
      "traditional": "小明：上次我從日本回來，一點時差都沒有。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng shàng cì wǒ cóng rì běn huí lái yì diǎn shí chā dōu méi yǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Last time when I came back from Japan, I didn't have jet lag at all."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "红红：当然了！日本和中国只差了一个小时。",
      "traditional": "紅紅：當然了！日本和中國只差了一個小時。",
      "pinyin": "hóng hóng dāng rán le rì běn hé zhōng guó zhǐ chà le yí ge xiǎo shí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "美国和中国差了十二个小时呢！",
      "traditional": "美國和中國差了十二個小時呢！",
      "pinyin": "měi guó hé zhōng guó chà le shí èr ge xiǎo shí ne",
      "english": "Honghong: Of course! There is only a one hour difference between China and Japan."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But between China and the US it is a 12 hour difference!"
    }
  ],
